      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The examination of 40 patients with generalized lipodystrophy elucidated the dependence of the severity of cardiovascular disorders in these patients on the immunoreactive insulin/C-peptide index. In high values of the latter cardiovascular disorders occur more frequently. The role of insulin in pathogenesis of essential hypertension, chronic IHD is assessed."},
